      "type": "text",
      "text": "WHY USE THIS?\n",
      "size": 20,
      "color": "#1565C0",
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Inheritance shares behavior among related types; subclasses should preserve the base-class contract.\n\n",
      "size": 16,
      "color": "#212121"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "CORE EXPLANATION\n",
      "size": 20,
      "color": "#6A1B9A",
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "A subclass inherits behavior and attributes from a base class. ",
      "font": "NimbusSans",
      "size": 16,
      "color": "#212121"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "super()",
      "font": "NimbusSans",
      "size": 16,
      "color": "#1565C0",
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " can call a base-class implementation.\n\n",
      "font": "NimbusSans",
      "size": 16,
      "color": "#212121"
    },
